hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24288","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, al-Jurayri informed us, from Abu al-Ala', from Abu Muslim al-Jadhmi, from al-Jarud, who said: I said, or a man said: O Messenger of Allah, lost property we find? He said: Announce it, and do not conceal, and do not hide away. If you find its owner, hand it to him; otherwise, it is Allah's wealth which He gives to whom He wills."
"24289","Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us, from Qatadah, from Abu Muslim, from al-Jarud ibn al-Mu'alla, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: The stray of the Muslim is the burning of the Fire."
